@startuml 10-vehicle-states
' UML state machine: the status of a vehicle (ADR-0007, ADR-0008). Every transition is a server function.
!include style.iuml
hide empty description
skinparam nodesep 34
skinparam ranksep 46

state "Available\n« Disponible »" as Available
state "Rented\n« En cours »" as Rented
state "Maintenance" as Maintenance
state "Archived\n« Archivé »" as Archived

[*] --> Available : vehicle added
Available : a Départ needs a
Available : complete reference photo set
Available --> Rented : Départ signed
Rented --> Available : Retour signed\nor contract voided
Available --> Maintenance : maintenance started
Maintenance --> Available : routine maintenance finished
Maintenance --> Available : repair finished\n[new reference set complete]
Available --> Archived : archived
Maintenance --> Archived : archived
Archived --> Available : restored
@enduml
